window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>How could one of the most powerful vampires on this earth be taken and held against his will?</b></p> <p>I was captured, tortured, and held captive until I feared I would go mad.</p> <p>Then he brought her to me, tempting me with the taste of her blood.</p> <p>Our souls call out to each other, bounding us for all eternity.</p> <p>Only death can separate us.</p> <p>I don't care who you are. Touch what belongs to me, and I will wipe you from the face of this earth.</p> <p>How can I be his when he's betrothed to another?</p> <p>My heart has been torn out of my chest and stamped on so many times, leaving me broken, and yet my soul still yearns for his.</p>"; 
